        ("Bay island moorings", "Bayfront lots on the dredged islands can come with a private dock, a deck locker and a boat under a cover that sits idle for weeks. That is plenty of time for a swarm to move into a hull compartment. Our [[svc:waterfront-boats|dock and boat removals]] cover this."),
