        ("North Beach", "From around 63rd Street up to 87th Terrace, taking in Normandy Isle, Biscayne Point and North Shore. This is where the city keeps a large collection of Miami Modern (MiMo) buildings. Directly north is [[city:surfside|Surfside]]."),
