        ("My building is in the Art Deco district. Does repairing the wall after removal need city approval?", "Alterations in local historic districts are measured against the city's appropriateness criteria, though the planning department says repairs, exterior paint and facade restoration can usually be cleared by staff. Our written scope lists each cut and each patch, which gives staff something concrete to look at."),
        ("Can your crew get onto Palm Island or into a guarded building?", "Yes, with your help. Put the crew on the guard gate's visitor list or let the front desk know to expect us, and send any parking or freight elevator rules ahead of time. That way nobody loses an hour at the gate."),
